                select nome as d, 
                       idfilial as r
                  from roman.vw_filiais
                 where tipofilial in ('D','A','L')
                   and ativo = 'S'
                   and ididioma = :P690_IDPAIS
                ```
            nullDisplayValue: - Todas -
            nullReturnValue: -1
